function currentNode(p){if(p.mode==='direct')return null;let t=p.target.kind==='shared'?scheme(p.target.id):p.target;if(!t)return null;if(t.kind==='direct')return null;if(t.kind==='node')return node(t.id||t.node);const ids=expandedMembers(t.members);if(t.strategy==='select')return node(t.node)||node(ids[0]);if(t.strategy==='urltest')return ids.map(node).filter(n=>n.delay!==null).sort((a,b)=>a.delay-b.delay)[0];return ids.map(node).find(n=>n.delay!==null)||node(ids[0]);}
